{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out for a consultation and craft a realistic, person-centered plan for better balance.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6f5f2;
      --card:#ffffff;
      --muted:#6b6b6b;
      --accent:#6aa84f;
      --accent-2:#8ab6d6;
      --ink:#222;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --max:1100px;
      --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, 'Roboto Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
      background:var(--bg) url('assets/img/pattern.svg') repeat;
      color:var(--ink);
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.45;
      padding:2rem 1rem;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
    }
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);width:100%;}

    /* Nav */
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:1.25rem}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:.75rem;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 .45rem;font-weight:600}
    nav a.cta{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:.45rem .7rem;border-radius:8px}

    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:1rem;align-items:start}

    /* Hero / Contact card */
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:1.25rem;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(20,20,20,0.06)}
    .hero{display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start}
    .hero h1{margin:.1rem 0 0;font-size:1.6rem}
    .hero p{margin:.5rem 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
    .meta{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-top:.8rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:grid;gap:.6rem}
    label{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:.65rem;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;background:var(--glass);font-size:1rem}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:.6rem}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;margin-top:.6rem}
    button{border:0;padding:.6rem .9rem;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:700}
    button.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #ddd;color:var(--ink)}

    /* Sidebar with Session Planner */
    .aside{position:sticky;top:1.5rem}
    .planner h3{margin:.2rem 0 .6rem}
    .pill{display:inline-block;background:#f0f6f0;padding:.2rem .5rem;border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:700;font-size:.86rem}

    /* Masonry-like story grid */
    .masonry{column-count:2;column-gap:1rem}
    .card{break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), rgba(255,255,255,0.8));border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #efefef}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}

    /* Reveal animations */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1),transform .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1)}
    .reveal.revealed{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    /* Footer CTA */
    .footer-cta{margin-top:1rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .small{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Utilities */
    pre.summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f6f8f7;padding:.8rem;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed #e3e3e3;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.92rem}
    .hint{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">HM</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="hint">A thoughtful approach to steadying health rhythms</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
        <a href="services.html">Pathways</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="panel reveal" data-reveal>
        <div class="hero">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <h1>Reach out and we’ll map a realistic next step</h1>
            <p class="muted">Use the form or the planner to outline what you need. No pressure—just clear options and an honest next meeting.</p>
            <div class="meta">
              <div><strong>Phone</strong><div class="muted">{{PHONE}}</div></div>
              <div><strong>Email</strong><div class="muted">{{EMAIL}}</div></div>
              <div><strong>Location</strong><div class="muted">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="width:220px;text-align:right">
            <div class="pill">Intro sessions</div>
            <div style="font-size:.95rem;margin-top:.6rem;color:var(--muted)">Short consults to shape a balanced plan</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr style="border:none;height:1px;background:#f1f1f1;margin:1rem 0">

        <form id="contactForm" aria-label="Contact form">
          <div class="row">
            <label style="display:block">Your name<input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="First and last"></label>
            <label style="display:block">Best phone<input type="text" name="phone" placeholder="Optional"></label>
          </div>
          <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"></label>
          <label>Reason for reaching out<select name="reason">
            <option>New consultation</option>
            <option>Follow-up</option>
            <option>Care coordination</option>
            <option>Questions about services</option>
          </select></label>
          <label>Message<textarea name="message" placeholder="Share briefly what brings you here"></textarea></label>
          <div class="actions">
            <button type="submit">Send request</button>
            <button type="button" class="secondary" id="quickCall">Request a callback</button>
            <div style="margin-left:auto" class="hint">We aim to respond within 48 hours</div>
          </div>
        </form>

      </section>

      <aside class="aside reveal" data-reveal>
        <div class="panel planner">
          <h3>Session Planner</h3>
          <div class="hint">Create a short, practical plan you can try in the coming weeks.</div>

          <form id="plannerForm" aria-label="Session planner">
            <label>Primary concern
              <select name="goal" required>
                <option value="Sleep support">Sleep support</option>
                <option value="Digestive balance">Digestive balance</option>
                <option value="Stress resilience">Stress resilience</option>
                <option value="Chronic pain management">Chronic pain management</option>
                <option value="Energy and focus">Energy and focus</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>Preferred session length
              <select name="length">
                <option>25 minutes</option>
                <option>50 minutes</option>
                <option>80 minutes</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>Frequency
              <select name="frequency">
                <option>One session</option>
                <option>Weekly for 4 weeks</option>
                <option>Biweekly for 8 weeks</option>
                <option>Monthly check-ins</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>Modalities (pick up to 3)
              <div style="display:flex;gap:.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:.4rem">
                <label style="font-size:.9rem"><input type="checkbox" name="m" value="Acupuncture"> Acupuncture</label>
                <label style="font-size:.9rem"><input type="checkbox" name="m" value="Nutrition coaching"> Nutrition coaching</label>
                <label style="font-size:.9rem"><input type="checkbox" name="m" value="Mindfulness training"> Mindfulness training</label>
                <label style="font-size:.9rem"><input type="checkbox" name="m" value="Herbal support"> Herbal support</label>
                <label style="font-size:.9rem"><input type="checkbox" name="m" value="Movement therapy"> Movement therapy</label>
                <label style="font-size:.9rem"><input type="checkbox" name="m" value="Sleep hygiene"> Sleep hygiene</label>
              </div>
            </label>
            <label>Notes / constraints<textarea name="notes" placeholder="Allergies, schedule limits, preferences"></textarea></label>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;margin-top:.5rem">
              <button type="button" id="buildPlan">Build plan</button>
              <button type="button" class="secondary" id="clearPlan">Clear</button>
              <div style="margin-left:auto" class="hint">Generate a plain-text plan you can copy.</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:.8rem">
              <pre id="planSummary" class="summary" aria-live="polite">Your plan will appear here.</pre>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin-top:.5rem">
                <button type="button" id="copyPlan">Copy plan</button>
                <button type="button" class="secondary" id="downloadPlan">Download .txt</button>
                <div class="hint" id="copyStatus" style="margin-left:auto"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </form>
        </div>

        <div style="height:1rem"></div>

        <div class="panel masonry">
          <div class="card">A short note on approach: we aim for small, testable steps that connect to your day-to-day life.</div>
          <div class="card">Sessions combine listening, measurable practices, and options you can try between meetings.</div>
          <div class="card">If you are managing medical conditions, we collaborate with your other clinicians with your permission.</div>
          <div class="card">We do not promise cures. Our work is educational and supportive—tailored to what you can realistically adopt.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <section class="reveal" data-reveal>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:1rem">
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">Still unsure?</div>
          <div class="muted">Schedule a 20-min clarifying call and we'll sketch a sensible first week.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a class="cta" href="book.html" style="display:inline-block;padding:.6rem .9rem;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent-2);color:white;text-decoration:none">Begin a Prelude</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="reveal" data-reveal style="margin-top:1.5rem;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)">
      <div class="small">Contact page — {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const reveals = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]'));
      if(prefersReduced){
        reveals.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('revealed'));
        return;
      }

      const onScroll = ()=>{
        const h = window.innerHeight;
        reveals.forEach(el=>{
          if(el.classList.contains('revealed')) return;
          const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();
          if(rect.top < h - 60){
            el.classList.add('revealed');
          }
        });
      };
      onScroll();
      window.addEventListener('scroll', throttle(onScroll, 150));

      function throttle(fn, wait){
        let last = 0;
        return function(...args){
          const now = Date.now();
          if(now - last > wait){
            last = now; fn.apply(this,args);
          }
        };
      }
    })();

    // Session Planner logic
    (function(){
      const form = document.getElementById('plannerForm');
      const build = document.getElementById('buildPlan');
      const clear = document.getElementById('clearPlan');
      const summary = document.getElementById('planSummary');
      const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copyPlan');
      const downloadBtn = document.getElementById('downloadPlan');
      const copyStatus = document.getElementById('copyStatus');

      function gather(){
        const data = new FormData(form);
        const goal = data.get('goal') || 'General support';
        const length = data.get('length') || '50 minutes';
        const frequency = data.get('frequency') || 'One session';
        const notes = data.get('notes') || '';
        const modalities = data.getAll('m');
        return {goal,length,frequency,modalities,notes};
      }

      function buildPlan(){
        const {goal,length,frequency,modalities,notes} = gather();
        const picked = modalities.length ? modalities.slice(0,3).join(', ') : 'None chosen';
        const planLines = [];
        planLines.push('Personalized Plan Summary');
        planLines.push('------------------------');
        planLines.push('Primary focus: ' + goal);
        planLines.push('Session length: ' + length);
        planLines.push('Frequency: ' + frequency);
        planLines.push('Modalities to try: ' + picked);
        planLines.push('');
        planLines.push('First-week suggestions:');
        planLines.push('- Book the initial session as selected above.');
        planLines.push('- Try one small daily practice linked to the focus (e.g., 10m breathing for stress resilience).');
        planLines.push('- Track one simple measure (sleep hours, pain rating, energy score).');
        planLines.push('');
        planLines.push('Notes:');
        planLines.push(notes || '—');
        planLines.push('');
        planLines.push('If you have medical conditions, consider informing your primary clinician before changes. This is educational and supportive, not a replacement for medical care.');
        return planLines.join('\n');
      }

      build.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        summary.textContent = buildPlan();
        copyStatus.textContent = '';
      });

      clear.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        form.reset();
        summary.textContent = 'Your plan will appear here.';
        copyStatus.textContent = '';
      });

      copyBtn.addEventListener('click', async ()=>{
        try{
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(summary.textContent);
          copyStatus.textContent = 'Copied to clipboard';
          setTimeout(()=>copyStatus.textContent='',2500);
        }catch(e){
          copyStatus.textContent = 'Copy failed';
          setTimeout(()=>copyStatus.textContent='',2500);
        }
      });

      downloadBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const blob = new Blob([summary.textContent], {type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});
        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        const a = document.createElement('a');
        a.href = url;
        a.download = 'session-plan.txt';
        document.body.appendChild(a);
        a.click();
        a.remove();
        URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
      });

      // Quick contact helpers
      document.getElementById('quickCall').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        alert('We will call you—please include your phone number in the form or use the booking page to choose a time.');
      });

      // Simple accessibility: submit form handler
      document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', (e)=>{
        e.preventDefault();
        alert('Thanks — your request has been recorded. We will reply to ' + (new FormData(e.target).get('email') || 'your email') + '.');
        e.target.reset();
      });

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page — Holistic / Integrative Medicine site (chunk 4)

Files included in this chunk:

- contact.html — A self-contained contact page with a Session Planner widget and a scroll-triggered reveal system. This file references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg (include a unique SVG there for full effect).

What this page provides:

- A responsive, accessible contact interface with placeholders to be replaced at deploy time:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}

- Navigation linking to the rest of the site pages: index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html. The nav labels were chosen to be distinct: Welcome, Pathways, Concerns, Method, Investment, About, Book, Connect.

- Scroll-triggered section reveal implemented in vanilla JS. It respects the user preference for reduced motion (prefers-reduced-motion) and reveals sections progressively when they enter view. No external libraries are used.

- Session Planner widget:
  - Let users select a primary focus, session length, frequency, and modalities.
  - Builds a concise plain-text plan summary geared toward a first-week practical approach.
  - Copy-to-clipboard and download-as-.txt features are implemented with local JS.
  - The planner produces a modest, educational plan and includes a brief medical disclaimer in the summary.

- Lightweight CSS for an asymmetric, masonry-like sidebar and clean contact layout. The page uses an assets/img/pattern.svg background reference (provide your custom SVG there).

Accessibility notes:

- Form controls include labels; the planner summary uses a <pre> with aria-live to announce updates.
- The reveal animation is disabled for users who prefer reduced motion.

Local testing:

1. Place this file in a web root with other site files (index.html, etc.).
2. Add an SVG at assets/img/pattern.svg or adapt the CSS background as desired.
3. Open contact.html in a browser. JavaScript runs without build steps.

Customization:

- Replace placeholders with real values at build/deploy time.
- Tweak planner options and copy text to match clinical and legal guidance for your practice.

Notes:

- This page intentionally avoids guaranteeing outcomes and uses supportive, educational language only.
- The contact form here is a simple front-end demonstration. Integrate server-side handling or a booking API as needed for production.

If you need the complementary assets (pattern.svg) or other pages (index.html, services.html, etc.), request the next chunk and include the seed/slug for continuity."}
